{"_id": "human_resources--hr_policies:_doc--n--67449", "text": "{\n    \"policy_id\": \"EMP-BNF-002\",\n    \"policy_title\": \"Comprehensive Retirement Plan\",\n    \"policy_description\": \"This document details the comprehensive retirement plan offered to employees, including 401k matching, pension options, and financial planning resources.  It also covers rules regarding vesting schedules, early withdrawal penalties, and beneficiary designations.  Furthermore, there are detailed explanations of different investment strategies available within the plan, along with associated risk assessments and historical performance data. The plan also addresses complex situations such as QDROs and hardship withdrawals. This policy is subject to change based on market conditions and regulatory updates and is administered by a third-party provider.  Detailed FAQs and contact information for the provider are included at the end of the document.  A glossary of terms is also provided to assist employees in understanding the complexities of the plan.  Finally, this document outlines the procedures for enrolling in the plan, making changes to contributions, and accessing account statements.\",\n    \"effective_date\": \"2023-01-01\",\n    \"last_updated\": \"2023-11-15\",\n    \"applicable_departments\": [\n        \"Sales\",\n        \"Marketing\"\n    ],\n    \"policy_document_url\": \"https://example.com/retirement-plan\"\n}"}
